From 0ee78abdd5bd1fc9825af368d7d48980f8f4cf55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: root <root@ubuntu.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Apr 2026 22:31:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Refactor SDL input to use SDL_GameController API

- Replace SDL_Joystick with SDL_GameController for standardized mappings
- Replace custom joystick events with SDL_CONTROLLERBUTTONDOWN/UP and SDL_CONTROLLERAXISMOTION
- Update default mappings (CONTROL_DEFAULT2_FIRE1, etc) to use SDL_CONTROLLER_BUTTON_*
- Replace static key name arrays with dynamic SDL_GameControllerGetStringForButton/Axis
- Reduce JOY_MAX_INPUTS from 64 to 35 to fit controller constraints
